# The memory corpus is append-only: every worker adds its own entries to the
# index and to its topic file as part of the DONE contract. Parallel appends
# from sibling branches are not a conflict — keep both sides.
#
# Note GitHub's merge machinery ignores this driver, so a promotion PR can
# still open CONFLICTING on a file that merges cleanly locally; the remedy is
# a merge-based re-sync, never a rebase (see liz promote.md).
.liz/memory/*.md merge=union
